---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact Bright Picks" description="Get in touch with Bright Picks — questions, suggestions, corrections and partnerships.">
  <section class="pad">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> · Contact</p>
      <h1>Contact us</h1>
      <p class="lead">We love hearing from readers and collaborators. For anything at all, email <a href="mailto:brightpicks26@gmail.com">brightpicks26@gmail.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>Suggestions &amp; feedback</h2>
      <p>Think we've missed a great gadget, or want to see a category we don't cover yet? Tell us — reader suggestions shape what we review next.</p>

      <h2>Corrections</h2>
      <p>We strive for accuracy, but products and prices move fast. If you spot something out of date or wrong, let us know and we'll fix it.</p>

      <h2>Media &amp; partnerships</h2>
      <p>For media or partnership enquiries, please include the relevant details of your proposal and we'll get back to you.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
